msgid ""
"Master switch. When off, the bound gesture and the Open Glimpse entry do "
"nothing – a quick way to silence Glimpse without unbinding its gesture."
msgstr ""
"Asosiy o'tkazgich. O'chirilganda, bog'langan imo-ishora va Glimpse'ni ochish"
" yozuvi hech narsa qilmaydi – uning imo-ishorasini uzmasdan Glimpse'ni "
"jimlashtirishning tez usuli."

msgid ""
"Assign or change it under Taps and gestures → Gesture manager → (pick a "
"gesture) → Reader → 'Open Glimpse'."
msgstr ""
"Uni Teginish va imo-ishoralar → Imo-ishora menejeri → (imo-ishorani tanlang)"
" → O'quvchi → 'Glimpse'ni ochish' bo'limida tayinlang yoki o'zgartiring."

msgid ""
"Browse the maps, family trees and other reference images found in this book,"
" without losing your reading position. Tip: bind the gesture action 'Open "
"Glimpse' for one-touch access."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu kitobda topilgan xaritalar, nasl daraxtlari va boshqa ma'lumot "
"rasmlarini o'qish holatingizni yo'qotmasdan ko'rib chiqing. Maslahat: bir "
"teginishli kirish uchun 'Glimpse'ni ochish' imo-ishora amalini bog'lang."

msgid ""
"Also show the pages you've bookmarked (the dogear bookmark) in the Gallery, "
"rendered as page thumbnails and marked with a bookmark badge, in reading "
"order alongside the images – a quick way to keep a reference page a swipe "
"away. Off by default. Also available from the viewer's ⋯ menu (see Quick "
"Actions)."
msgstr ""
"Galereyada siz xatcho'p qo'ygan sahifalarni ham ko'rsating (burchagi "
"buklangan xatcho'p), sahifa eskizlari sifatida va xatcho'p nishoni bilan "
"belgilangan, rasmlar yonida o'qish tartibida – ma'lumot sahifasini bir "
"surish uzoqlikda saqlashning tez usuli. Standart bo'yicha o'chirilgan. "
"Ko'ruvchi ⋯ menyusidan ham mavjud (Tezkor amallarga qarang)."

msgid ""
"Choose which actions appear in the viewer's ⋯ menu. Reset Rotation is "
"automatic (shown while an image is rotated)."
msgstr ""
"Ko'ruvchi ⋯ menyusida qaysi amallar ko'rinishini tanlang. Aylantirishni "
"qayta tiklash avtomatik (rasm aylantirilganda ko'rsatiladi)."

msgid ""
"Double-tap the image to jump to the maximum zoom (centered on the tap), and "
"again to return to the fitted view. On by default."
msgstr ""
"Maksimal masshtabga o'tish uchun rasmni ikki marta bosing (teginishga "
"markazlashgan) va moslashtirilgan ko'rinishga qaytish uchun yana bosing. "
"Standart bo'yicha yoqilgan."

msgid ""
"Swipe left or right across the image to move to the next or previous image. "
"On by default. (The Gallery's swipe-to-page is unaffected.)"
msgstr ""
"Keyingi yoki oldingi rasmga o'tish uchun rasm bo'ylab chapga yoki o'ngga "
"suring. Standart bo'yicha yoqilgan. (Galereyaning sahifaga-surish amaliga "
"ta'sir qilmaydi.)"

msgid ""
"Pinch or spread two fingers on the image to zoom out or in. On by default."
msgstr ""
"Kichraytirish yoki kattalashtirish uchun rasmda ikki barmoqni chimchilang "
"yoki yoying. Standart bo'yicha yoqilgan."

msgid ""
"Where Glimpse opens: a side panel (left or right) or, in portrait, a band "
"across the top or bottom. In landscape it always uses the preferred side."
msgstr ""
"Glimpse qayerda ochiladi: yon panel (chap yoki o'ng) yoki tik holatda yuqori"
" yoki pastdagi tasma. Yotiq holatda u har doim afzal ko'rilgan tomondan "
"foydalanadi."

msgid ""
"How far you can zoom in, as a percentage of the image's own resolution. "
"Double-tap jumps to this level and pinch stops here. Higher reveals more on "
"detailed maps, but past 100% it is upscaling, so very high can look soft."
msgstr ""
"Rasmning o'z ruxsatining foizi sifatida qanchalik kattalashtira olishingiz. "
"Ikki marta bosish shu darajaga o'tadi va chimchilash shu yerda to'xtaydi. "
"Yuqoriroq batafsil xaritalarda ko'proq ochib beradi, ammo 100% dan keyin bu "
"kattalashtirishdir, shuning uchun juda yuqori xira ko'rinishi mumkin."

msgid ""
"Let the ‹ › buttons and swipes wrap around at the ends: Next on the last "
"image goes to the first, and Previous on the first goes to the last. The "
"Gallery pages wrap the same way."
msgstr ""
"‹ › tugmalari va surishlar oxirlarida aylanib o'tsin: oxirgi rasmdagi "
"Keyingi birinchisiga o'tadi, birinchisidagi Oldingi esa oxirgisiga. Galereya"
" sahifalari ham xuddi shunday aylanadi."

msgid ""
"Show ‹ and › buttons in the viewer for switching between images, as an "
"alternative to swiping. A button is grayed out when there is no image on its"
" side."
msgstr ""
"Rasmlar orasida almashish uchun ko'ruvchida ‹ va › tugmalarini ko'rsating, "
"surishga muqobil sifatida. Tugma tomonida rasm bo'lmaganda xira bo'ladi."

msgid ""
"Show a vertical −/fit/+ control in the viewer for zooming in and out, as an "
"alternative to double-tap and pinch. The middle button returns to the fitted"
" view."
msgstr ""
"Kattalashtirish va kichraytirish uchun ko'ruvchida vertikal "
"−/moslashtirish/+ boshqaruvini ko'rsating, ikki marta bosish va "
"chimchilashga muqobil sifatida. O'rta tugma moslashtirilgan ko'rinishga "
"qaytaradi."

msgid ""
"While zoomed in, show a small overview of the image with a rectangle marking"
" the visible area. Tap the map to jump there. It docks to the zoom controls "
"when those are on, and is hidden at the fitted view."
msgstr ""
"Kattalashtirilganda, ko'rinadigan hududni belgilaydigan to'rtburchak bilan "
"rasmning kichik umumiy ko'rinishini ko'rsating. U yerga o'tish uchun "
"xaritani bosing. U yoqilgan masshtab boshqaruviga ulanadi va moslashtirilgan"
" ko'rinishda yashiriladi."

msgid ""
"While KOReader's night mode is on, show images inverted (light lines on a "
"dark background). Also toggleable from the viewer's ⋯ menu."
msgstr ""
"KOReader tungi rejimi yoqilganida, rasmlarni invertlangan holda ko'rsating "
"(qorong'i fonda ochiq chiziqlar). Ko'ruvchi ⋯ menyusidan ham almashtiriladi."

msgid ""
"Show the image's caption from the book, overlaid in the viewer's top-left "
"corner."
msgstr ""
"Kitobdan rasm izohini ko'ruvchining yuqori chap burchagida ustma-ust "
"ko'rsating."

msgid ""
"On a bookmarked page, show a label with the page number and chapter in the "
"viewer's top-left corner. Turn off to hide it."
msgstr ""
"Xatcho'p qo'yilgan sahifada, ko'ruvchining yuqori chap burchagida sahifa "
"raqami va bob bilan yorliq ko'rsating. Yashirish uchun o'chiring."

msgid ""
"Show the position as a compact \"3 / 42\" counter instead of a row of dots. "
"Useful when a book has so many images that the dots pill grows very wide. "
"Off by default. (With many images Glimpse switches to the counter on its "
"own; this makes it always so.)"
msgstr ""
"Holatni nuqtalar qatori o‘rniga ixcham \"3 / 42\" hisoblagich sifatida "
"ko‘rsatadi. Kitobda shunchalik ko‘p rasm bo‘lsaki, nuqtalar paneli juda "
"kengayib ketganda foydali. Standart bo‘yicha o‘chiq. (Rasmlar ko‘p bo‘lganda"
" Glimpse o‘zi hisoblagichga o‘tadi; bu parametr uni doim shunday qiladi.)"

msgid ""
"On (default): while the viewer is open, a tap along the top edge opens "
"KOReader's top menu over the drawer, but only when KOReader itself opens its"
" menu on a tap (Settings → Taps and gestures → menu activation includes "
"Tap). Off: Glimpse keeps the top edge for itself, so a top tap never opens "
"the menu."
msgstr ""
"Yoniq (standart): ko‘ruvchi ochiq bo‘lganda, yuqori chetga teginish "
"tortmacha ustida KOReader yuqori menyusini ochadi, lekin faqat KOReader o‘zi"
" menyuni teginish bilan ochsa (Sozlamalar → Teginishlar va imo-ishoralar → "
"menyu faollashtirilishi Teginishni o‘z ichiga oladi). O‘chiq: Glimpse yuqori"
" chetni o‘zi uchun saqlaydi, shuning uchun yuqoriga teginish menyuni hech "
"qachon ochmaydi."

msgid ""
"By default Glimpse sets aside covers, publisher logos, ornaments and other "
"non-reference imagery, keeping maps, family trees, diagrams and "
"illustrations. Enable this to switch that off and see every image in the "
"book. (Individual wrongly-kept images can instead be ignored from the "
"viewer's ⋯ menu; wrongly set-aside ones added back from the Gallery's "
"Ignored tab.)"
msgstr ""
"Standart bo'yicha Glimpse muqovalar, nashriyot logotiplari, bezaklar va "
"boshqa ma'lumot bo'lmagan tasvirlarni chetga surib qo'yadi, xaritalar, nasl "
"daraxtlari, diagrammalar va tasvirlarni saqlab qoladi. Buni o'chirish va "
"kitobdagi har bir rasmni ko'rish uchun buni yoqing. (Xato saqlangan alohida "
"rasmlarni buning o'rniga ko'ruvchi ⋯ menyusidan e'tiborsiz qoldirish mumkin;"
" xato chetga surilganlarini Galereyaning E'tiborsiz qoldirilgan yorlig'idan "
"qaytarish mumkin.)"

msgid ""
"Silence the message shown when Glimpse is opened on a book format it doesn't"
" support (PDF, comics, manga…). Handy if a reading gesture sometimes "
"triggers Glimpse on non-EPUB files. Off by default."
msgstr ""
"Glimpse qo'llab-quvvatlamaydigan kitob formatida (PDF, komikslar, manga…) "
"ochilganda ko'rsatiladigan xabarni jimlashtiring. Agar o'qish imo-ishorasi "
"ba'zan Glimpse'ni EPUB bo'lmagan fayllarda ishga tushirsa qulay. Standart "
"bo'yicha o'chirilgan."

msgid ""
"Remove the drawer's drop shadow. The shadow is a dithered gradient – the "
"main cause of e-ink ghosting behind the drawer – so turn it off if a ghost "
"lingers after closing Glimpse. No visible effect on LCD screens."
msgstr ""
"Tortmaning tushuvchi soyasini olib tashlang. Soya dizerlangan gradient – "
"tortma ortidagi e-ink arvohlanishining asosiy sababi – shuning uchun Glimpse"
" yopilgandan keyin arvoh qolsa uni o'chiring. LCD ekranlarda ko'rinadigan "
"ta'sir yo'q."

msgid ""
"Switch between images with a quick, flashless refresh instead of a full "
"clear. On by default: faster and no flash. Turn it off if the previous image"
" ghosts through the next one – most noticeable on detailed maps and on "
"slower e-ink panels. No visible effect on LCD screens."
msgstr ""
"Rasmlar orasida to'liq tozalash o'rniga tez, chaqnashsiz yangilash bilan "
"almashing. Standart bo'yicha yoqilgan: tezroq va chaqnashsiz. Agar oldingi "
"rasm keyingisidan ko'rinsa uni o'chiring – batafsil xaritalarda va sekinroq "
"e-ink panellarda eng sezilarli. LCD ekranlarda ko'rinadigan ta'sir yo'q."

msgid ""
"Glimpse caches its scan of the book. Use this if the book file was replaced "
"or images seem out of date."
msgstr ""
"Glimpse kitob skanerini keshlaydi. Agar kitob fayli almashtirilgan yoki "
"rasmlar eskirgan ko'rinsa, bundan foydalaning."

msgid ""
"Also offer releases marked as pre-release on GitHub – test builds published "
"before a proper release. Normal update checks never see those."
msgstr ""
"GitHub'da old nashr deb belgilangan nashrlarni ham taklif qiling – to'g'ri "
"nashrdan oldin chop etilgan sinov to'plamlari. Oddiy yangilanish "
"tekshiruvlari ularni hech qachon ko'rmaydi."

